n slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Asking for Things in a Store ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " In a clothing store, you can ask for the size and the color you want.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Size\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Color\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Does this come in a size ... ?<br/>Do you have this in a ... ?<br/>Do you have this in small/medium/large?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Does this come in a different color?<br/>Do you have this in ... ?<br/>What other colors does this come in?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Sizes", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Different countries and stores have different ways of measuring sizes.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In North America, sizes of clothes like coats and shirts are often measured in words: <span class = \"strong\">small</span>, <span class = \"strong\">medium</span> or <span class = \"strong\">large</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "These words are often written in the letter form:<br/>XS = extra small<br/> S = small<br/> M = medium<br/> L = large<br/> XL = extra large", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Shoes are usually measured in numbers (7 - 13).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Belts and jeans are usually measured by the size of the person's waist (28\" - 40\"). The \" sign means <span class = \"italic\">inches</span> (= 2.5 cm).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Dresses are usually measured in numbers  (0 - 18).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Coats and Shirts\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Shoes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Jeans/Belts (Waist)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Dresses\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"small (S)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"7 - 8\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"28\\\" - 32\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"0 - 4\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"medium (M)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"9 - 10\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"34\\\" - 36\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"6 - 10\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"large (L)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"11 - 13\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"38\\\" - 40\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"12 - 18\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "This dress is a size 18.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I wear size 9 shoes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Do you have this in a 28\" waist?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shoes", "type": "name"}, {"content": "what you wear on your feet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need new shoes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you shop for shoes.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pair", "type": "name"}, {"content": "set of two", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have three pairs of shoes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to spend", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to pay out money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can only spend $125 on shoes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "bargain", "type": "name"}, {"content": "at a very low price", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: These shoes were a bargain - only $25.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to cost", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the price of an item", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: These shoes cost $99.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "I'll take", "type": "name"}, {"content": " I want to buy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll take these shoes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "budget", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the amount of money you can spend", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have a budget of $200 for shoes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "reduced", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the price is lower  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: These shoes are reduced from $125 to $50.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find the website of a clothing store.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find 5 items.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find the sizes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Complete the table.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your findings with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Item of Clothing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sizes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border